  storyText: "Jack In\n\nYour body falls away. You're in the Net - or what's left of it after the DataKrash: broken architecture, floating code, darkness.\n\nMirage appears as a girl made of white light. \"This way. Stay close.\"\n\n1. Follow Mirage.\n2. Look around on your own."
